      "notes": [
        "f4/f5 流头 (stream:stream to/from example.com version 1.0)；f6 AUTH PLAIN；f7 SUCCESS；f8/f9 流重启；f10 IQ bind_1 set (resource trafficgen)；f11 bind_1 result；f12 sess_1 set；f13 sess_1 result；f14 presence 自闭合标签；f15/f16 '</stream:stream>' 流结束",
